            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life</strong><br>\nAlexander Graham Bell was born in 1847 in Edinburgh, Scotland. Influenced by his family's work in elocution and his mother's deafness, he developed an interest in sound and speech from an early age.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Invention of the Telephone</strong><br>\nBell is best known for inventing the telephone in 1876. His successful demonstration of speaking into one device and hearing the sound from a distant device was a pivotal moment in communication history.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Work with the Deaf</strong><br>\nAside from the telephone, Bell had a passionate dedication to working with the deaf. He considered this his most important work, even more significant than the telephone.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Other Inventions</strong><br>\nBell's curiosity led to the invention of the photophone, which transmitted a voice on a beam of light, and he also made advancements in aviation technology with the Silver Dart.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Founding of AT&amp;T</strong><br>\nBell's work led to the creation of the American Telephone and Telegraph Company (AT&amp;T) in 1885, which built on his telephone invention and became one of the largest corporations in the world.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Personal Life</strong><br>\nBell married Mabel Hubbard in 1877, who was one of his former deaf students. They had four children together, two of whom died in infancy.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
